etrieval_Augmented_Generation_with_Graphs_GraphRAG","page":14,"quote":"While retrieved information is typically ordered by relevance scores during the retrieval process, these scores are often based on coarse-grained rankings across a large set of candidates."},{"id":"c2","chunkId":"14671c78fc7de99d_c_56b6a3130a6fa051","docId":"14671c78fc7de99d","docTitle":"2405.14831_HippoRAG_Neurobiologically_Inspired_Long_Term_Memory_for_Large_Languag","page":3,"quote":"These same three components are then leveraged to perform online retrieval by mirroring the human brain’s memory retrieval process."},{"id":"c3","chunkId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f_c_445a807c7c2b8b50","docId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f","docTitle":"2312.10997_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Large_Language_Models_A_Survey","page":5,"quote":"This approach transcends the fixed RAG retrieval process by evaluating the necessity of retrieval based on different scenarios."},{"id":"c4","chunkId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f_c_993787ecb894fd47","docId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f","docTitle":"2312.10997_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Large_Language_Models_A_Survey","page":11,"quote":"Graph-Toolformer, for instance, di- vides its retrieval process into distinct steps where LLMs proactively use retrievers, apply Self-Ask techniques, and em- ploy few-shot prompts to initiate search queries."},{"id":"c5","chunkId":"14671c78fc7de99d_c_2428bbb77a4838ab","docId":"14671c78fc7de99d","docTitle":"2405.14831_HippoRAG_Neurobiologically_Inspired_Long_Term_Memory_for_Large_Languag","page":29,"quote":"8Since the original IRCoT does not provide a score for each retrieved passage, we employ beam search for the iterative retrieval process."},{"id":"c6","chunkId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f_c_cdd36691fb020a53","docId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f","docTitle":"2312.10997_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Large_Language_Models_A_Survey","page":5,"quote":"ch not only streamlines the retrieval pro- cess but also significantly improves the quality and relevance of the information retrieved, catering to a wide array of tasks and queries with enhanced precision and flexibility."},{"id":"c7","chunkId":"ac529ab762fd1672_c_2d3e81f1878b7c8e","docId":"ac529ab762fd1672","docTitle":"HybridRAG: Integrating Knowledge Graphs and Vector Retrieval Augmented Generation for Efficient Information Extraction","page":6,"quote":"This retrieval process is fine-tuned with spe- cific filters for quarters, years, and company names, ensuring that the retrieved information is both relevant and current."},{"id":"c8","chunkId":"730f1a9f38d16689_c_f33b63884369fa88","docId":"730f1a9f38d16689","docTitle":"2404.16130_From_Local_to_Global_A_Graph_RAG_Approach_to_Query_Focused_Summarizati","page":2,"quote":"In canonical RAG approaches, the retrieval process returns a set number of records that are seman- tically similar to the query and the generated answer uses only the information in those retrieved records."},{"id":"c9","chunkId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f_c_b67ed6095dcc2598","docId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f","docTitle":"2312.10997_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Large_Language_Models_A_Survey","page":11,"quote":"IRCoT [61] uses chain-of-thought to guide the retrieval process and refines the CoT with the obtained retrieval results."},{"id":"c10","chunkId":"bd72eebf611df136_c_4e853abd2d421dad","docId":"bd72eebf611df136","docTitle":"2410.05779_LightRAG_Simple_and_Fast_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":8,"quote":"This dual-level approach ensures both breadth in the retrieval process and depth in the analysis, providing a comprehensive view of the data."},{"id":"c11","chunkId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459_c_57e0ba6b88f8a81e","docId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459","docTitle":"2501.00309_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_with_Graphs_GraphRAG","page":24,"quote":"Thus, it becomes essential to consider document-level relationships in the retrieval process."},{"id":"c12","chunkId":"bd72eebf611df136_c_0b8db5d2f8670657","docId":"bd72eebf611df136","docTitle":"2410.05779_LightRAG_Simple_and_Fast_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":16,"quote":"The dual-level retrieval process employed by LightRAG enables a more comprehensive investigation of specific entities and their interrelationships, facilitating extensive searches that effectively capture overarching themes and"},{"id":"c13","chunkId":"bd72eebf611df136_c_e9df6097cc5772ef","docId":"bd72eebf611df136","docTitle":"2410.05779_LightRAG_Simple_and_Fast_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":2,"quote":"2) After the retrieval process, the generation component takes the retrieved information and generates coherent, contextually relevant responses."},{"id":"c14","chunkId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459_c_327e971396103b7e","docId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459","docTitle":"2501.00309_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_with_Graphs_GraphRAG","page":7,"quote":"For example, given the question, \"What is the best way to guess the color of the eye of the baby?\", NER extracts entities such as \"baby\", \"eye\", and \"color\", which correspond to nodes in the knowledge graph and are treated as the seed"},{"id":"c15","chunkId":"ac529ab762fd1672_c_c43994cfc848d101","docId":"ac529ab762fd1672","docTitle":"HybridRAG: Integrating Knowledge Graphs and Vector Retrieval Augmented Generation for Efficient Information Extraction","page":6,"quote":"At the core of our system is a Pinecone vector database7, which serves as the foundation for our information retrieval process."},{"id":"c16","chunkId":"743155d9b0541c99_c_8faf205d52225055","docId":"743155d9b0541c99","docTitle":"2401.15391_MultiHop_RAG_Benchmarking_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Multi_Hop","page":2,"quote":"We demonstrate this multi-hop retrieval process in Figure 1."},{"id":"c17","chunkId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f_c_7335f0306ab8fa20","docId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f","docTitle":"2312.10997_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Large_Language_Models_A_Survey","page":11,"quote":"olformer, for instance, di- vides its retrieval process into distinct steps where LLMs proactively use retrievers, apply Self-Ask techniques, and em- ploy few-shot prompts to